      "value": "@{5b28d7576ec5d16bbac6c445|full_name}: I agree too. Sadly in 2019 even though marriage is pretty open the haters have been replaced with snowflakes and they get very opening offended which could cause a lot more issues than that is worth it. \n\nDoesn't mean its a bad feature though if they did implement it but as far as moderation goes on this game its just 1 more thing to complain that isn't being moderated.",
