      "value": "@{5ccf25209c1b5663b79b5892|full_name}: That sounds like a great addition to it i would really like if this idea would be considered. It would help alot to bring more immersion into the game and it really doesnt harm anyone.\nYou could add this symbol like you did with the avatar rating.\nAnd i really like to show everyone my husband when i get one.",
